    "本功能展示的生产时间基于单条串行链路计算，即从原材料到成品的最长路径耗时。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbols": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Production time is calculated along one serial chain: the longest path from raw materials to the finished product."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用中的所有蓝图分享码均来自社区玩家自发贡献，开发者仅提供展示平台。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbols": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All blueprint share codes in this app are contributed by community players. The developer only provides a platform for displaying them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本模块为玩家自制的非官方工具，与《明日方舟：终末地》官方无关。\n\n建筑和配方数据来自游戏解包与社区资料，产能、电力等结果是按简化规则模拟的估算，可能与游戏内实际表现不一致，请以游戏内为准。规划结果仅供参考。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbols": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an unofficial, player-made tool and is not affiliated with Arknights: Endfield.\n\nFacility and recipe data comes from unpacked game files and community sources. Production, power, and other results are estimates based on simplified simulation rules and may differ from the game. Always use in-game results as the reference. Plans are for reference only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
